'''Hatsune Miku XVI''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 722
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Hatsune Miku XVI
|name2 = Hatsune Miku XVI CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Hatsune Miku XVI CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Hatsune Miku XVI works much like pre-[[True Form]] [[Adventurer Kanna (Uber Rare Cat)|Adventurer Kanna]]. The two have very similar overall stats, however Hatsune Miku has lower range and cooldown, higher health, and [[Slow]] and [[Strong Against|Strong]], instead of [[Massive Damage]] and [[Multi-Hit]]. This means she's more oriented towards Crowd-Controlling than pure damage like Kanna is. Because [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] is already so good against Dark enemies, this leaves her only real targets against Freeze immune Dark enemies. She does decently against them, especially since her Surge Attack is centered near the edge of her attack, giving her good piercing range that she desperately needs with her 350 base range.

{{Job|Classification = Sniper & Crowd-Controller}}

